IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-FLASHINFER-V2.

DATA DIVISION.
01 SEQ-LEN             PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 NUM-HEADS           PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 HEAD-DIM            PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 HEAD-SPLITS         PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-FLASHINFER-V2.
    IF SEQ-LEN == 0 OR NUM-HEADS == 0 OR HEAD-DIM == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE NUM-HEADS TO HEAD-SPLITS.
    MULTIPLY 2 BY HEAD-SPLITS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 HEAD-SPLITS.
    WEIGHT 30 NUM-HEADS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
